#   CLASS-GENERAL (no witness IRI hardcoded): QUANTIFIES OVER EVERY fnd:AbelianGroup instance via
#   rdf:type/rdfs:subClassOf* fnd:AbelianGroup (raw-graph property path; catches the abelian witness AND the
#   module additive group fnd:moduleAddGroup, both genuinely commutative Z/3), mirroring the SHACL
#   fnd:AbelianCommShape under inference=rdfs.
#   DATA CONTRACT (algebra_spine.ttl): at least one op row exists on some ?m a fnd:AbelianGroup (non-vacuity
#     anchor, FALSE on the empty graph - the symmetric rows A.B=E and B.A=E); and NO pair (x,y) over ANY
#     fnd:AbelianGroup-typed model has x.y != y.x.
#   PROBE OF RECORD (must flip True->False, mirrored by fnd:AbelianCommShape): change fnd:appAbBA
#     fnd:opResult from fnd:elemE to fnd:elemB (so B.A = B while A.B = E) - the inner EXISTS finds it, and the
#     ASK is FALSE; a FRESH non-commutative fnd:AbelianGroup instance flips it the same way.
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
